sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Buyer
    participant API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Seller

    Buyer->>API: POST chat session and offer with idempotency key
    API->>DB: lock listing context and persist pending offer
    Seller->>API: POST /offers/{id}/accept
    API->>DB: lock product and offer, then set product RESERVED
    API->>DB: create one order and initial order event
    API-->>Seller: accepted offer and order
    Buyer->>API: POST meetup proposal
    API->>DB: save version N and reset confirmations
    Buyer->>API: confirm meetup version N
    Seller->>API: confirm meetup version N
    API->>DB: set MEETUP_ARRANGED only when both versions equal N
    Buyer->>API: confirm completion for version N
    Seller->>API: confirm completion for version N
    API->>DB: set COMPLETED and product SOLD, then append event
    API-->>Buyer: completion result and review notification
    API-->>Seller: completion result and review notification
